Speed, elapsed time, it all comes down to horsepower.

27
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:27,240
Astonishingly, once stripped of their massive airtake funnels

28
00:02:27,241 --> 00:02:30,480
and exhaust pipes.

29
00:02:30,481 --> 00:02:32,640
At their core, these engines aren't much different

30
